Runtime fault [R0802]: use of storage after its lifetime ended in `pointer is used only after arena reset to prove quarantine`
  --> unsafe_sentries.jet:7, in #Unsafe gate "pointer is used only after arena reset to prove quarantine"
 Why: The storage was released or its owning Jet frame expired before this raw `read`; the gate's lifetime obligation was not met.
 Fix: Do not use the pointer after release or frame exit — obligation `valid_ptr` was not met on this run.
obligation: valid_ptr = false
exit: 1
More: jet-lang.dev/e/R0802
